      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;consumption&#34;&gt;Consumption&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;details class=&#34;details-box&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;Can cats eat cannabis leaves?&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;details-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p&gt;Yes. Leaves are full of nutrients and some cats seem to like them.&#xA;There is no harm in cats eating your fan leaves.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;imgcard&#34; style=&#34;max-width: 20%&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/cat1.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;A cat eating a fan leaf&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;figcaption class=&#34;imgcard-caption&#34;&gt;A cat eating a fan leaf&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;details class=&#34;details-box&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;Why do I get the munchies?&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;details-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p&gt;Cannabinoids stimulate the release of a hunger molecule called &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/articles/ghrelin/&#34; class=&#34;redlink&#34;&gt;&amp;ldquo;ghrelin&amp;rdquo;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;.&#xA;Also food tastes better!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;details class=&#34;details-box&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;Edibles vs. Smoking&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;details-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p&gt;When you inhale cannabis, you are inhaling Delta-9 THC, and goes from lungs to blood stream, so the effects are very quick.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
